### Feature Supplier — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (isActive = false)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

# @name deleteSupplierPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/proveedores/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteSupplierLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/proveedores/{{id}}/deactivate
